		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Documentation officielle de postgres 8.4 : <a href="http://www.postgresql.org/docs/8.4/interactive/textsearch-controls.html" rel="nofollow">http://www.postgresql.org/docs/8.4/inte … trols.html</a></p><p>...<br />Also, * can be attached to a lexeme to specify prefix matching:</p><p>SELECT to_tsquery(&#039;supern:*A &amp; star:A*B&#039;);<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; to_tsquery&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />--------------------------<br /> &#039;supern&#039;:*A &amp; &#039;star&#039;:*AB<br />Such a lexeme will match any word in a tsvector that begins with the given string.<br />...</p>]]></content>
